ent-MachineFtlSuppressorTsf = BS-1000 "Bastion" bluespace suppressor
    .desc = A TSF interdiction device. While powered it projects a 1 km bluespace suppression field that no ship can FTL out of or into, including the ship carrying it.

ent-MachineFtlSuppressorPdv = "Lasso" bluespace suppressor
    .desc = A compact Phaeton Dynasty interdictor. While powered it projects a 750 m bluespace suppression field that no ship can FTL out of or into, including the ship carrying it.
